-- The 1 June 2026 article lists seven classes (CCIO 4* Short … CCI P 2* Long) without naming their event. Those 29
-- results were saved under a placeholder event and lost their class names. The class names are in the article, so
-- they are put back here, and rows with nothing else wrong are marked as read cleanly. They stay hidden from the site
-- until the event is named in the owner area (Unverified tab) and they are verified. Matched on the article and the line as written.

